  "job_B8.4.3.1_20251003_114835": {
    "chunk_text": "; So\u00f0lice heofona rice geneal\u00e6c\u00f0. \u00dea se H\u00e6lend eode wi\u00f0 \u00f0a galileiscean S\u00e6; He geseh twegen gebro\u00f0ru, Symonem se w\u00e6s genemned So\u00f0lice hi w\u00e6ron fisceras. & he s\u00e6de him, Cuma\u00f0 \u00e6fter me & ic do \u00fe\u00e6t gyt beo\u00f0 manna fisceras. & hi \u00fe\u00e6rrihte forleton hyra net & him fyligdon. And \u00fea he \u00feanon eode he geseh twegen o\u00f0re gebro\u00feru, Iacobum Zebedei & Iohannem his bro\u00feur on Hi \u00f0a sona forleton hyra nett & hyra f\u00e6der & him fylidon. & \u00fea beferde se H\u00e6lend ealle Galileam l\u00e6rende on hyra gesomnungum; & he w\u00e6s bodiende godspel & \u00f0a ferde hys hlisa into ealle Syriam; & hi brohton him ealle yfelh\u00e6bbende missenlicum adlum & & him fyligdon mycele menigu fram Galilea & fram Decapoli & fram Hierusalem & fram Iudea & So\u00f0lice \u00fea se H\u00e6lend geseh \u00fea menigu he astah on \u00feone munt; & \u00fea he s\u00e6t \u00fea geneal\u00e6hton his & he ontynde his mu\u00f0 & l\u00e6rde hi & cw\u00e6\u00f0. Eadige synt \u00fea gastlican \u00feearfan for\u00feam hyra ys heofena rice. Eadige synt \u00fea li\u00f0an for\u00feam \u00fee hi eor\u00f0an agun. Eadige synt \u00fea \u00f0e nu wepa\u00f0 for\u00feam \u00fee hi beo\u00f0 gefrefrede. Eadige synt \u00fea \u00f0e rihtwisnesse hingria\u00f0 & \u00feyrsta\u00f0 for\u00feam \u00fee hi beo\u00f0 gefyllede. Eadige synt \u00fea mildheortan for\u00feam \u00fee hi mildheortnysse begyta\u00f0. E",
